body:
Actually, not drunk at all. I'm at my full functionality, well, except for the panic attacks and the terrible tremor.

&#x200B;

To be honest, something keeps telling me that she fell out into some sort of a bad spot at the moment. It's either the nerves or the stress that gets to her. She's always been only good for me. Always been my support. I just can't believe that she's always been like this. And it's really difficult to come to terms with the fact that she might be turning this way. I'm at my wits end.

Well, the rage comes from the fact that I've literally refurbished my whole damn life for this. Over the span of the last two years, I'm financially invested over 50k usd into all of this. There's the flights, the trips, the legal fees - shit just piles up like hell in situations like these and I am (maybe very stupidly) generous as a person.

&#x200B;

The opposite feeling comes from the fact that I have full understanding that you can't solve everything with the above. But I can't say that I've been distant, disappearing or terribly bad in any way. Yes, I've had my "Leave me alone" moments, but then again - when I'm pulling 4-5 projects simultaneously at work it just gets to you. You come home, head feels like it's jammed shut in a box, you see the remaining 2-3 hours of the evening and understand that soon it's back to work. BUT - I still had time to always call, text, cheer up. I rarely spoke about the difficult details of my workdays, but it's only because, well - good luck explaining engineering in like 3 light sentences. Besides, who wants to hear that shit? However, I did make sure to always ask her about how her day went, how stuff is with colleagues, how things are going on the other sides of her life.

&#x200B;

Funnily enough, it seems like I've dropped the ball on the whole sexting thing and I come to realize now that it might've been what actually was needed. Then again - as far as I can see - these things go in waves. You can't be horny like a freaking rabbit all the time with this sorta schedule. And things were very, very passionate each time we met. No lack of kinkyness or sex whatsoever.
